  - TF-IDF
  - data mining

abstract: >
  A complete implementation and evaluation of four recommendation approaches
  on the MARS French e-learning dataset: user-based collaborative filtering
  with cosine and Pearson similarity, item-based content-based filtering via
  TF-IDF, and mean-centred Truncated SVD matrix factorisation. Key findings
  include that Pearson similarity outperforms cosine for this dataset due to
  rating-scale bias from the watch-percentage derivation mechanism, and that
  mean-centred SVD (k=20) achieves RMSE 2.2678, Precision@5 0.0708, and
  Recall@5 0.0179 on the test set.

